<title>HONG KONG: Number of HK-registered firms rose 2.4 pct in 1996.</title>
<headline>Number of HK-registered firms rose 2.4 pct in 1996.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The number of companies registered in Hong Kong reached 483,181 in 1996, an increase of 2.4 percent from the year before, the government said on Friday.</p>
<p>The number of overseas companies registered stood at 4,604 last year, 287 more than in 1995, it said.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6441</p>
</text>
